     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi friend,<div><br></div><div>Please try:</div><div><br></div><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><img src=\"https://groups.google.com/group/taiwanruser/attach/6823467ebebdd/optim.png?part=0.1&amp;view=1\" alt=\"optim.png\" width=\"400\" height=\"260\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\"></p><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px\"><code><div><font color=\"#666600\"><div>set.seed(168)</div><div>samplesize &lt;- 35</div><div>mydf &lt;- data.frame(age=round(seq(20, 60, length.out = 35)+rnorm(35,5,2)),</div><div>                   circumference=round(runif(35,80,110)))</div><div><br></div><div>errorI &lt;- function(x) {</div><div>  total=0</div><div>  w1 &lt;- x[1]</div><div>  w2 &lt;- x[2]</div><div>  for(i in 1:nrow(mydf)) {</div><div>    total &lt;- total + (log(mydf$age[i]) - (w1*mydf$circumference[i])/(w2+mydf$circumference[i]))^2</div><div>  }</div><div>  total</div><div>}</div><div><br></div><div>optim(c(0.5, 0.3), fn=errorI, method=&quot;L-BFGS-B&quot;)</div></font></div></code></div><br><br>嘿嘿於 2018年10月13日星期六 UTC+8上午5時36分25秒寫道：</div></div>"
